{
    "title": "Ghost Shooting: hunting games",
    "description": "Do you want to be a hunting sniper? Let's play this cool shooting game for free! In each city, criminal organizations carry out dirty deals and criminal activities. You are a hunting sniper with superb hiding skills and hitman abilities. Track their whereabouts like a ghost assassin, for the cities\u2019 peace and justice, pick up your guns, assassinate the top leader of the evil forces, guard the city like a ghost!\r\n\r\nCOMPLETE THE BOUNTY MISSIONS\r\nOver hundreds of missions can be completed in the shooting games, including fighting against gang members, assassinating organization leaders, and preventing dirty deals, etc. Please bury the gang forces quietly and let the evil sleep forever.\r\n\r\nPOWERFUL ARSENAL\r\nThere are a variety of different guns in this hunting sniper shooting game that look cool and have powerful attributes. You can build your own firearms arsenal, upgrade gun parts to improve attributes, which can help you complete missions better.\r\n\r\nADVENTURES IN DIFFERENT CITIES\r\nThe evil force is spreading to different cities. After completing the missions in one city, you need to go to the next one. Each city has different missions, show your assassin hitman abilities, clean up all the enemies.\r\n\r\nMISSION ASSISTANT\r\nDifficult missions exist in this gun game, but don\u2019t worry, please use the drone to locate the targets if you can\u2019t find them, you will finish missions easier.\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n* A 3d sniper shooting game for free\r\n* Exquisite art style and 3d display, give you an immersive hitman feeling\r\n* Excellent level design, each level has a different hunting sniper experience\r\n* Easy control to play, use different guns to enjoy the game\r\n* Fast-paced shooting, a great hitman shooting game to kill time\r\n* Multiple cities\u2019 missions, free feel the customs of different cities\r\n* A variety of guns can be chosen, complete missions easier\r\n* Relaxing music and sound effects, feel the leisure atmosphere\r\n\r\nGhost Shooting is a 3d gun hitman action fps game. Use sniper guns to aim at the enemy, eliminate a target with a shot, destroy all the gangster forces. In the hitman gun shooting games, you can choose different guns, finish missions of different difficulties, improve hunting shooting skills in each mission, and become a professional elite shooter to make the enemy frightened. If the mission is difficult, remember to upgrade gun parts, and use drones to lock on targets faster. No enemy can escape within your sniper field of view! Join Ghost Shooting now, use your hitman assassin skills to become a hunting sniper!\r\n\r\nWelcome to join our community!\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/ghostshootinggame/\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/r6rNBFaz5g",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to be a hunting sniper? Let&#39;s play this cool shooting game for free! In each city, criminal organizations carry out dirty deals and criminal activities. You are a hunting sniper with superb hiding skills and hitman abilities. Track their whereabouts like a ghost assassin, for the cities\u2019 peace and justice, pick up your guns, assassinate the top leader of the evil forces, guard the city like a ghost!<br><br>COMPLETE THE BOUNTY MISSIONS<br>Over hundreds of missions can be completed in the shooting games, including fighting against gang members, assassinating organization leaders, and preventing dirty deals, etc. Please bury the gang forces quietly and let the evil sleep forever.<br><br>POWERFUL ARSENAL<br>There are a variety of different guns in this hunting sniper shooting game that look cool and have powerful attributes. You can build your own firearms arsenal, upgrade gun parts to improve attributes, which can help you complete missions better.<br><br>ADVENTURES IN DIFFERENT CITIES<br>The evil force is spreading to different cities. After completing the missions in one city, you need to go to the next one. Each city has different missions, show your assassin hitman abilities, clean up all the enemies.<br><br>MISSION ASSISTANT<br>Difficult missions exist in this gun game, but don\u2019t worry, please use the drone to locate the targets if you can\u2019t find them, you will finish missions easier.<br><br>GAME FEATURES:<br>* A 3d sniper shooting game for free<br>* Exquisite art style and 3d display, give you an immersive hitman feeling<br>* Excellent level design, each level has a different hunting sniper experience<br>* Easy control to play, use different guns to enjoy the game<br>* Fast-paced shooting, a great hitman shooting game to kill time<br>* Multiple cities\u2019 missions, free feel the customs of different cities<br>* A variety of guns can be chosen, complete missions easier<br>* Relaxing music and sound effects, feel the leisure atmosphere<br><br>Ghost Shooting is a 3d gun hitman action fps game. Use sniper guns to aim at the enemy, eliminate a target with a shot, destroy all the gangster forces. In the hitman gun shooting games, you can choose different guns, finish missions of different difficulties, improve hunting shooting skills in each mission, and become a professional elite shooter to make the enemy frightened. If the mission is difficult, remember to upgrade gun parts, and use drones to lock on targets faster. No enemy can escape within your sniper field of view! Join Ghost Shooting now, use your hitman assassin skills to become a hunting sniper!<br><br>Welcome to join our community!<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ghostshootinggame/<br>Discord: https://discord.gg/r6rNBFaz5g",
